### Bug #2 — Division by zero trong 2 panel KPI quan trọng

**business-metrics-dashboard, Panel 2 — Payment Success Rate:**
```promql
# ❌ Khi 0 payments trong 24h → denominator = 0 → hiển thị +Inf hoặc NaN
100 * (sum(increase(payment_completed_total[24h]))
     / (sum(increase(payment_completed_total[24h]))
      + sum(increase(payment_failed_total[24h]))))

# ✅ Fix
100 * (sum(increase(payment_completed_total[24h]))
     / clamp_min(sum(increase(payment_completed_total[24h]))
              + sum(increase(payment_failed_total[24h])), 1))
```

**business-metrics-dashboard, Panel 4 — Email Delivery Success:**
```promql
# ❌ Tương tự khi email_sent_total = 0
100 * (sum(increase(email_sent_success_total[24h]))
     / sum(increase(email_sent_total[24h])))
```

